      "writtenOn": "2023-04-18T10:06:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How is it that we can have 2 networks with the same interface name ? This will generally not work in a lot of places in netd. We should discuss with the WiFi folks to understand how this happens.",
      "revId": "8736cd95ba906afbda7fbb36989567a453d5eecc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c7b070fa_0c3c8865",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
